a={**common,'record_id':str(uuid.uuid4()),'scope':'eval016 PM resource reconciliation caption clarification','observation':'Tracker002 new_historical_records includes newly observed current resources as well as earlier removed resources. Its repeated caption that inventory-only polling omitted every newly registered name overstates missed historical inventory. Counts in immutable proofs remain valid.','root_cause':'One display caption conflated first registration with a historical polling omission.','prevention':'Report newly registered names separately from recorded present and absent classifications; do not infer missed retirement coverage from total new names. Prepare corrected tracker caption for future PM refreshes.','verification':{'rows':rows,'controller_sha256':sha(Path(__file__))},'evidence':[x['evidence'] for x in rows]}
